    "title": "Bridgefield Civic League preps for Debutante Cotillion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Isabella Giardina ,\n2 hours ago\nThe Bridgefield Civic League is preparing for its Debutante Cotillion on Nov. 7.\nThe cotillion uplifts young women and men ages 16–19, teaching leadership, cultural pride and social responsibility.\nThe group is still recruiting participants, hoping to make this year's cotillion the best one yet.",
